Cell["\<\
Sometimes Mathematica will not display the full curve from 0 to the final \
value. I get around this by either plotting the curve twice with two \
different ranges can circumvent this issue, or fitting the data to a much \
broader range than visualized in the Plot.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.929718267978724*^9, 3.92971841481321*^9}, {
  3.931610264899293*^9, 3.931610425917897*^9}, {3.931611645672571*^9, 
